  "pageText": "[Home] ↣ [Privacy Protections Tests] ↣ [Request Blocking Test Page]\n\nThis page tests if different types of requests, made using various browser mechanisms, are getting blocked.\n\nTo test your request blocking solution please add bad.third-party.site domain to your blocklist.\n\nStart the test Download the results\nHTML\n - script - Try loading a JavaScript file using <script> element.\n - style - Try loading a CSS file using <link> element.\n - img - Try loading an image using <img> element.\n - picture - Try loading an image using <picture> element.\n - object - Try loading an image using <object> element.\n - audio - Try loading an audio file using <audio> element.\n - video - Try loading a video file using <video> element.\n - iframe - Try loading a frame using <iframe> element.\nCSS\n - import - Try loading a CSS file using @import url(…).\n - font - Try loading a font file using @font-face {src: url(…)}.\n - background - Try loading an image using background: url(…).\nJS\n - websocket - Try connecting to a WebSocket.\n - server-sent-events - Try connecting to an EventSource.\n - fetch - Try requesting data using fetch(…).\n - xmlhttprequest - Try requesting data using XMLHttpRequest.\n - sendBeacon - Try sending data using sendBeacon.\nOther\n - favicon - Try loading an image using <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" ….\n - iframe-fetch - Try requesting data from within a first-party iframe.\n - iframe-fetch-depth-2 - Try requesting data from two frames deep (iframe within an iframe).\n - webworker-fetch - Try fetching data from within a WebWorker.\n - serviceworker-fetch - Try fetching data from within a ServiceWorker.\n - csp-report - Try sending data via CSP report.\n - redirected-fetch - Try requesting tracker via redirect through a safe domain.\n\nLegend:\n\n - request has loaded\n - request hasn't loaded\n - request failed (e.g. due to being blocked)\nDebug data:\nhtml - style\nhtml - img \nhtml - picture \nhtml - object\nhtml - audio\nhtml - video \nhtml - iframe \ncss - import\ncss - font\ntext\ncss - background\nother - iframe-fetch \nother - iframe-fetch-depth-2 \nother - csp-report ",
